{"3368400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tretrais", "steam_appid": 3368400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>🚀 Welcome to Tretrais: Mars Was Waiting for You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The near future. A routine transit just a few hours past Mars, nothing unusual. Until your ship starts failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You reach the escape pod. It locks onto Mars. The descent begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you hit the red dirt, everything changes. Something is wrong with this planet. You can feel it before the dust even settles, before you've taken your first breath. Mars is not silent. Mars <strong>has been waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Tretrais Mission</strong> begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛸 No Breaks: A Relentless, Escalating Threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies don't attack on a schedule they <strong>keep coming</strong>, and every wave hits harder, arrives faster, and brings something new. Leaping creatures, explosive organisms, long-range attackers, heavily armored heavies each one demands a different response. The longer you hold out, the more Mars pushes back.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧠 Traps and Turrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow enemies with spike traps and mud pits, blow them apart with explosives, and lock down your perimeter with auto-firing turrets. Every second on Mars counts placement is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Traps and Turrets to Strengthen Your Defense</strong><br>When your weapons aren’t enough, traps and turrets come into play. Place spike traps, slowing mud, and explosive mines to halt enemies in their tracks. Surround your base with auto-firing turrets to build a strong defensive perimeter. Smart placement can be a lifesaver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ Explore Mars: The Answers Are Out There</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is this planet like this? What do these creatures want? As you scavenge for parts and push deeper into the map, you'll find that Mars has secrets buried beneath its surface and they've been waiting a long time. Every discovery raises new questions. But your time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️ About Early Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tretrais is in active development. The core survival experience, enemy system, weapon mechanics, and base building are all playable now. Co-op, new enemy types, and deeper map content will be added in future updates. Your feedback directly shapes the game - thank you for being part of it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/4be922700959f30107fdb22430379324.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>🚀 Welcome to Tretrais: Mars Was Waiting for You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The near future. A routine transit just a few hours past Mars, nothing unusual. Until your ship starts failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You reach the escape pod. It locks onto Mars. The descent begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you hit the red dirt, everything changes. Something is wrong with this planet. You can feel it before the dust even settles, before you've taken your first breath. Mars is not silent. Mars <strong>has been waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Tretrais Mission</strong> begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/a39a1510cadd9911faaacf1573abcc76.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛸 No Breaks: A Relentless, Escalating Threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies don't attack on a schedule they <strong>keep coming</strong>, and every wave hits harder, arrives faster, and brings something new. Leaping creatures, explosive organisms, long-range attackers, heavily armored heavies each one demands a different response. The longer you hold out, the more Mars pushes back.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/5786df29441364226151bb7e0c9bf5b8.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧠 Traps and Turrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow enemies with spike traps and mud pits, blow them apart with explosives, and lock down your perimeter with auto-firing turrets. Every second on Mars counts placement is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/8272ce2779e50869e9a45c742c3d4d5c.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Traps and Turrets to Strengthen Your Defense</strong><br>When your weapons aren’t enough, traps and turrets come into play. Place spike traps, slowing mud, and explosive mines to halt enemies in their tracks. Surround your base with auto-firing turrets to build a strong defensive perimeter. Smart placement can be a lifesaver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.poster.avif?t=1777050351\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368400/extras/596cfd0b2dbf19d80251c5f924e1e65b.webm?t=1777050351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ Explore Mars: The Answers Are Out There</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is this planet like this? What do these creatures want? As you scavenge for parts and push deeper into the map, you'll find that Mars has secrets buried beneath its surface and they've been waiting a long time. Every discovery raises new questions. But your time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️ About Early Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tretrais i